{"__q": {"t": "Предлоги и фразовые глаголы — Сборник 3", "q": [{"s": "Complete: «He succeeded ___ passing the exam.»", "o": ["in", "to", "at", "for"], "e": "«Succeed in» + герундий."}, {"s": "Complete: «I apologized ___ being late.»", "o": ["for", "about", "to", "of"], "e": "«Apologize for»."}, {"s": "Complete: «They accused him ___ stealing.»", "o": ["of", "for", "with", "about"], "e": "«Accuse somebody of»."}, {"s": "Complete: «She insisted ___ paying.»", "o": ["for", "to", "at", "on"], "e": "«Insist on» + герундий."}, {"s": "Complete: «He is responsible ___ the project.»", "o": ["of", "to", "on", "for"], "e": "«Responsible for»."}, {"s": "Complete: «This depends ___ the weather.»", "o": ["on", "at", "from", "of"], "e": "«Depend on»."}, {"s": "Complete: «I congratulated him ___ his success.»", "o": ["with", "for", "on", "about"], "e": "«Congratulate somebody on»."}, {"s": "Complete: «She's not capable ___ doing it.»", "o": ["for", "of", "to", "in"], "e": "«Capable of» + герундий."}, {"s": "Complete: «We'll carry ___ with the work.»", "o": ["on", "off", "in", "out"], "e": "«Carry on» — продолжать."}, {"s": "Complete: «The teacher handed ___ the papers.»", "o": ["off", "out", "in", "up"], "e": "«Hand out» — раздавать."}]}, "Prepositions and Phrasal Verbs — 3-ci toplu": "Предлоги и фразовые глаголы — Сборник 3"}